      "evidence": "crates/alopex-embedded/tests/copy_sql.rs",
      "issue": 172,
      "notes": "Embedded/CLI table/query-to-file CSV/Parquet, CLI CSV stdin/stdout, and application-owned Rust/Python CSV streams are implemented. File output uses atomic replacement; JSON is rejected explicitly; HTTP/gRPC reject COPY rather than exposing server paths or process stdio. PostgreSQL wire-level COPY remains a known divergence."
